{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Trckify 是一款結合 iPhone、Apple Watch 記錄與 Mac 深度分析的運動追蹤工具，適合喜歡跑步、單車、遠足、划艇及滑雪等活動的人士。它可規劃路線、即時導航、記錄心率與速度，並把軌跡化成 3D 地圖及分享故事。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-142.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多功能運動記錄與分析</h2>\n<p>Trckify 可規劃單車、越野或步行路線，提供爬升圖、轉向提示及偏離路線警示，並按最佳時間為路線評分。運動時可一鍵以 iPhone 或 Apple Watch 記錄速度、距離、心率、步頻及划艇槳頻，支援 Watch 獨立模式與 GPS 自動切換。完成後可在 3D 地形地圖查看速度、高度及熱圖，加入標記，或匯出 GPX、FIT 至 Strava 等平台，亦可製作故事圖分享。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-597-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-598-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-599-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-600-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-601-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-602-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Trckify</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/trckify/id6761343148?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:44.363220+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:36:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:42.496411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:23.339838+00:00","content_hash":"761c3da2d1fdef04443756353cc6fefe2c6a8c66a4a12d73deee15c1d5faee44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}